  "solution": {
    "text": "All <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>AAAAA</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>CCC</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>EE</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></math> can be arranged in <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>!</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac></math> ways.<br />Between the gaps <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> can be arranged in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow></mrow><mn>13</mn></mmultiscripts></math> ways<br />Hence, the total number of ways <math><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mmultiscripts><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></mrow><mrow><mn>13</mn></mrow></mmultiscripts></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>!</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac></math>"
